242 - Jesus, Thou Joy of Loving Hearts
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 242
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[G]Jesus, Thou [C/G]joy [C#m/G#]of [C/E]loving hearts!
[F#dim]Thou [G]fount [Am]of [Bm]life! [G/D]Thou [F#dim]light [C/G]of [D/F#]men!
[D7/C]From [Em/B]the [Am]best [C/G]bliss [Am/C]that [D7]earth [G]imparts,
[G]We [F#dim]turn [G]unfilled [C/G]to [Bm]Thee [G/D]again.

Verse 2:
[G]Thy truth unchanged [C#m/G#]has [C/E]ever stood;
[F#dim]Thou [G]savest [Bm]those [G/D]that [F#dim]on [C/G]Thee [D/F#]call;
[D7/C]To [Em/B]them [Am]that [C/G]seek [Am/C]Thee [D7]Thou [G]art good,
[G]To [F#dim]them [G]that find [C/G]Thee, [Bm]all [G/D]in [D7/C]all.

Verse 3:
[G]We taste Thee, [C/G]O [C#m/G#]Thou [C/E]living Bread,
[F#dim]And [G]long [Am]to [Bm]feast [G/D]upon [C/G]Thee [D/F#]still;
[D7/C]We [Em/B]drink [Am]of [C/G]Thee, [Am/C]the [D7]Fountainhead,
[G]And [F#dim]thirst [G]our souls [C/G]from [Bm]Thee [G/D]to [D7/C]fill!

Verse 4:
[G]Our restless [C/G]spirits yearn [D7/A]for [C]Thee,
[F#dim]Where-e'r [G]our [Am]changeful [F#dim]lot [C/G]is [D/F#]cast;
[D7/C]Glad, [Em/B]when [Am]Thy [C/G]gracious [Am/C]smile [G]we see,
[G]Blest, [F#dim]when [G]our faith [C/G]can [Bm]hold [G/D]Thee [D7/C]fast.

Verse 5:
[G]O Jesus, [C/G]ever with [D7/A]us [C]stay;
[F#dim]Make [G]all [Am]our [Bm]moments [F#dim]calm [C/G]and [D/F#]bright;
[D7/C]Chase [Em/B]the [Am]dark [C/G]night [Am/C]of [D7]sin [G]away,
[G]Shed [F#dim]o'r [G]the world [C/G]Thy [Bm]holy [D7/C]light!
